WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.742
Long and wide are not quality levels They are
different ways to arrange

00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:11.367
information Long data usually stores categories as
row values

00:00:13.099 --> 00:00:18.962
Wide data turns selected category values into
columns The dangerous

00:00:18.989 --> 00:00:24.581
part is that many pivots also aggregate When several
source rows map to

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:27.739
one pivot cell detail may be permanently removed
